{"term":"seksclub","lang":"nl","script":"latin","romanization":null,"category":"sex_work_pornography","subcategory":"sex_club","concept":"brothel","is_novel_concept":false,"register":"slang_neutral","crude":30,"technical":5,"recognition_pct_current":92,"recognition_pct_peak":92,"peak_year":null,"regional":null,"definition":"A sex club; a licensed establishment offering sexual entertainment and access to sex workers, often combining erotic shows or striptease with private rooms for services.","english_term":"sex club","english_translation_quality":"approximate","notes":"Distinct from a bordeel in that it typically has a club format with shows and common areas; requires a municipal exploitation license; often euphemized in advertising as 'erotisch entertainmentcentrum'."}
